<title>ESTONIA: TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</title>
<headline>TALIBOR AND TALIBID INTERBANK RATES STABLE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average interbank rates were</p>
<p>unchanged from the last week, the central bank said on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>There was no activity was on the money market last week,</p>
<p>ahead of the four-day weekend, a money market analyst said.</p>
<p>He added that the pressure is downwards.</p>
<p>    TALIBOR/TALIBID   1Week	 1Month    3Month</p>
<p>  June 25	    4.13/3.13  5.45/4.45  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>  June 18	    4.13/3.13  5.45/4.45  7.00/6.00</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
